# Project root — environment
# Copy to `.env`:  cp .env.example .env
#
# Only for variables Compose reads once per *project*. Per-service configuration
# belongs in that service's own .env (traefik/.env, open-webui/.env, and so on),
# which `include:` resolves against the service directory.

# Which llama.cpp GPU backend to run, if any:
#   cuda    NVIDIA + Container Toolkit  -> service llama-cuda
#   vulkan  AMD/Intel via /dev/dri      -> service llama-vulkan
#   unset   neither starts; the rest of the lab is unaffected
#
# Written by llama.cpp/detect-gpu.sh. It must be here rather than in
# llama.cpp/.env: Compose reads COMPOSE_PROFILES per project, and a copy in a
# service directory is silently ignored.
# COMPOSE_PROFILES=vulkan
